Answer every yes/no prompt with the buttons: Center is Yes, Menu is No.
Save and exit, Start new game, Replace this pet, a donation, a claimed
code and the matchmaker's offer show the keys on screen. The wheel no
longer toggles the answer, so these prompts show no choice dots.

